    ev_indexability_header: `HTTP header X-Robots-Tag: “{raw}”.`,
    why_indexability: `With “noindex” in its code, a page asks search engines not to include it. A page that is not in the index cannot be found through search, and AI search tools that build on search indexes do not know it either. “noindex” is often left over by mistake from a test environment. Snippet limits are the second half: “nosnippet”, a small “max-snippet” or data-nosnippet on the main text keep an indexed page from being quoted, and Google applies them to AI Overviews and AI Mode as well.`,
